# Per-stack state directory manifests.
#
# One file per stack, e.g. dsh.paths, with one entry per line:
#
#   $AGENT_HOME/.dsh:0700
#
# 10-ownership creates each path (and its parents) and chowns it to the agent
# user. $AGENT_HOME is expanded from the account's home directory; no literal
# uid and no literal /home/<user> path is needed in a stack Dockerfile.
